#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""pr-radar: a Mac app that tracks your GitHub PRs via `gh` and notifies you when they change.

Usage:
  pr-radar                 open PR Radar.app (building it first if needed)
  pr-radar install-app     (re)build ~/Applications/PR Radar.app, a py2app alias bundle pointing at this checkout
  pr-radar --once [--open] fetch once, write the dashboard, notify (--open shows it in your browser)

Settings live in ~/.config/pr-radar/config.json, generated data in ~/Library/Application Support/pr-radar.
"""
